DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T113000
UID:4bd874a881bb93e56c0ea668bd4477b1@events.yolocountylibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lap-sit program for babies ages 0 to 18 months a
 nd their caregivers followed by a Stay-and-Play. We will share songs\, lul
 labies\, fingerplays\, and board books!\n\nThe program is held indoors\, 
 in the Blanchard Room and is offered in two-month sessions. Each session i
 s limited to 30 families.\n\nThis program is offered by registration only
 . In addition\, all babies must have a Yolo County library account.
LOCATION:Blanchard Room\, Mary L Stephens Davis Branch Library
URL:https://events.yolocountylibrary.org/event/15531031
X-SOURCE:Yolo Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jack and the Beanstalk by Fratello Marionettes (Davis)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T170000
UID:38fb7811f11955b137988324b2beb452@events.yolocountylibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:A mysterious peddler trades Jack five magic beans for his cow
 \, and next thing you know\, a huge beanstalk grows high into the sky. Jac
 k climbs the beanstalk and discovers a grumpy giant in a castle in the clo
 uds. Does Jack make it back down safely and bring riches back to his mothe
 r? The marionettes are all handmade and the mastery of the performers is a
 mazing!
LOCATION:Blanchard Room\, Small Conference Room\, Mary L Stephens Davis Br
 anch Library
URL:https://events.yolocountylibrary.org/event/16141648
X-SOURCE:Yolo Library
END:VEVENT
